   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Xmas Curtain** (1 review): The performance opened with this track, noted as a standout choice [5]\n- **Touch Me I'm Going to Scream Pt. 2** (1 review): The two Touch Me songs were performed in reverse order [5]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Into the Woods**: back after 61 archived shows (1423 days); rare: 12 archived performances [6]\n- **Rocket Man**: rare: 12 archived performances [6]\n- **Touch Me I'm Going to Scream Pt. 1**: back after 40 archived shows (444 days) [6]\n- **It Makes No Difference**: rare: 7 archived performances [6]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **MMJ2012-08-17.MMJ2012-08-17** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 25 songs; 159 min; rated 3/5 by 3 [1]. Said about its sound: The recording quality is described as very nice [5]\n- **mmj2012-08-17.bobbybourbon.schoepsmk4v.flac16**: source not stated; 25 songs; 156 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The taping location was Orchestra A, Center Row E [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **MMJ2012-08-17.MMJ2012-08-17**: taped by Dan Gottlieb; source: AKG C391s > AKG B18s > Edirol R09-HR (24bit/48000khz) (6' stand next to SBD) [1]\n- **mmj2012-08-17.bobbybourbon.schoepsmk4v.flac16**: taped by Bobby Bourbon; source: Schoeps MK4V's>Sonosax SX-M2/L>Sony PCM-M10 [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by www.tbonealjax.com: [My Morning Jacket/ Band of Horses - Mann Center - 8.17.12](http://www.tbonealjax.com/2012/08/my-morning-jacket-band-of-horses-mann.html) [8]\n- Poster by My Morning Jacket: [2012 posters](https://forum.mymorningjacket.net/index.php/topic,16429.0.html) [9]",
